abstract: "Ant Stack — a reproducible research workspace for embodied AI and ant-inspired systems, pairing complexity-energetics analysis with automated Matplotlib/Mermaid figures and Pandoc + XeLaTeX manuscript rendering. Run manifests emit SHA-256 checksums per artifact, with a pytest suite."
